/**
 * Read a store's published menu
 *
 * The store's published menu: one document rebuilt within about a second of every change to its catalogue, stamped with a version that only rises and answered with that version as its entity tag (`"v<version>"`). Every reader gets the same snapshot, loaded once per version however many ask together. A client told of version N on the store's channel (`store-{location_id}-menu`, signal `menu.published`) reads it naming `version=N` and is never answered with an older one; `If-None-Match` with the tag it holds answers `304`. A category carries its first `page_size` items; `GET .../menu/categories/{category_id}` pages the rest.
 */
